c0ce4a6c-931d-468a-a01d-05b7980b2677	944bd00f-3f73-4bc2-9044-d95c79085dfa	assistant	GNC offers a variety of protein types to cater to different fitness goals. For instance, whey protein is fast-absorbing and great for muscle recovery, while casein is slow-absorbing, providing a steady release of amino acids, ideal for overnight use. We also have plant-based proteins that are lactose-free and suitable for those with dietary restrictions, as well as egg protein, which is highly bio-available. If you're looking to gain weight or muscle, we have specialized products like weight gainers and mass gainers as well. Let me know if you want more details on a specific type!	\N	2026-09-24 05:53:30.889
