2439a638-022d-47d7-947f-92fd5b655c24	rwa_president	How does FLATBRIZ compare to MyGate on payment gateway commission?	FLATBRIZ offers a significant advantage over MyGate when it comes to payment gateway commissions. While MyGate typically routes maintenance payments through a payment gateway that takes a commission on every transaction, FLATBRIZ employs a UPI-first collection method that charges zero gateway commission. This means that for a mid-size society collecting substantial amounts monthly, FLATBRIZ ensures that more of the residents' payments stay with the society, avoiding unnecessary financial leakage. \n\nAdditionally, FLATBRIZ's UPI collection posts payments directly to the flat's ledger without any extra settlement lag, enhancing both transparency and efficiency. Would you like to explore how this could impact your society's finances?	12	{objection:payment_gateway_lag,competitor:mygate}	f	2026-09-14 11:16:21.059
af6f59dc-1930-43c8-93d0-437759be7fff	builder	Our senior citizen residents will resist adopting a new app, how do you handle that?	I understand your concern about senior citizens potentially resisting a new app. However, adoption friction is often related to the initial installation process rather than the app itself. With FLATBRIZ being a Progressive Web App (PWA), residents can simply tap a link or scan a QR code with the Building Code to quickly add it to their home screen in seconds, without needing to navigate an app store or create an account. \n\nTo further ease the transition, you could provide a short one-page printed guide at the security desk and make a launch announcement when the building admin gets access. This approach addresses most of the friction as a one-time onboarding moment rather than an ongoing issue. Would you like to explore more about how to facilitate this process for your residents?	7	{objection:adoption_friction}	f	2026-09-14 11:16:22.984
9765ea32-92b3-49be-8f3b-5a6dd2582dac	committee_member	This looks good — can we get a demo and talk pricing? How do we get started with onboarding?	I'm glad to hear you're interested in FLATBRIZ! We can definitely arrange a demo to showcase the platform's features and benefits. Regarding pricing, it's important to compare the total cost rather than just the subscription fee. For instance, FLATBRIZ has zero gateway commission on UPI collections, which can lead to significant savings, especially for larger societies with high monthly collection volumes. \n\nAs for onboarding, we offer dedicated support to help configure your maintenance rules, flats, and committee accounts, ensuring a smooth transition without the need to re-key historical transactions. Would you like to discuss your current monthly collection amount to better understand the potential savings?	67	{objection:pricing,"get started",demo,onboard,onboarding}	f	2026-09-14 11:16:24.551
