43e5d12c-8059-43e0-a197-aaafad5ed898	rwa_president	Tell me about corpus fund management	FLATBRIZ offers a robust approach to corpus fund management by tracking sinking-fund contributions as a separate component of each bill. This ensures that the society's corpus balance remains visible and auditable, making it easy to report its position during AGMs without the need for manual reconciliation. This level of transparency not only protects the corpus but also saves time for RWA presidents by reducing disputes related to payments. Would you like to explore how this feature can specifically benefit your society?	2	{}	f	2026-09-14 11:16:27.826
98a4e97c-b49d-40a0-b8ac-596f922b1ba9	builder	How does FLATBRIZ handle payment gateway lag compared to MyGate?	FLATBRIZ addresses payment gateway lag effectively by utilizing a UPI-first collection method that posts payments directly to the flat's ledger, eliminating the extra settlement step that often introduces delays. This means that payments are reconciled automatically with the UPI transaction reference as proof, providing a more streamlined process. In contrast, MyGate typically routes maintenance payments through a payment gateway that incurs a commission on each transaction, which can contribute to delays and additional costs. \n\nWith FLATBRIZ, you avoid these issues entirely, ensuring that more of the funds collected stay with the society. How does your current payment settlement process work, and how many days does it typically take?	12	{objection:payment_gateway_lag,competitor:mygate}	f	2026-09-14 11:30:05.904
1ea04004-a7be-4b9e-90bd-5a5fe7f8f8ab	builder	Would it help to see a live example of how a UPI payment reconciles to a flat's ledger in real time?	Absolutely, seeing a live example can provide great clarity on how FLATBRIZ's UPI payment system works. With our UPI collection, payments are posted directly to the flat's ledger immediately, eliminating the lag often experienced with traditional payment gateways. Each transaction is matched to the correct flat's bill, and both residents and admins can view the same reconciled record, which enhances transparency and reduces disputes. Would you like to explore how this process could specifically address the payment gateway lag you're currently facing?	7	{objection:payment_gateway_lag}	f	2026-09-14 11:30:12.406
