e76bb4f7-2894-4864-897a-f31abf8f6ae2	committee_member	We currently track all our society accounts on a messy Excel spreadsheet with past dues. How hard is it to migrate our data to FLATBRIZ?	I understand that migrating from a messy Excel spreadsheet can feel daunting, but FLATBRIZ makes this process straightforward and low-risk. You won't need to reconstruct years of history; instead, you can set up your current flat list and any outstanding dues as opening balances. This means that billing will continue seamlessly from the next cycle without re-keying historical transactions. Additionally, we provide hands-on onboarding support specifically for this setup step, ensuring a smooth transition. Would you like to know more about the onboarding process?	7	{objection:spreadsheet_migration}	f	2026-09-15 05:23:31.655
