1627ee5f-1942-4914-b99f-675b83dc6ff0	committee_member	I manage three different housing societies as a committee member. Do I need separate accounts and logins for each one?	With FLATBRIZ, you can manage multiple housing societies under a single account, which simplifies your administrative tasks significantly. This means no need for separate accounts or logins for each society, allowing you to have full visibility and control over all the societies you manage in one place. This streamlined approach not only saves time but also enhances your ability to oversee finances and operations efficiently. Would you like to know more about how this can benefit your specific management needs?	2	{}	f	2026-09-15 05:23:47.997
