be8a8c9d-1cc7-40ca-b58c-560236b85205	builder	Why should I choose FLATBRIZ?	Choosing FLATBRIZ offers several advantages for builders and developers. Firstly, it provides a ready-made society-management setup that can be configured per building or tower, allowing for quick onboarding of new residents without app-store delays. This is particularly beneficial for those managing multiple projects, as you can replicate configurations across different buildings efficiently.\n\nAdditionally, FLATBRIZ features a UPI-first collection system for maintenance payments that incurs zero gateway commissions, unlike some competitors. This means more cost savings for your residents. Furthermore, FLATBRIZ allows for customizable maintenance and expense-splitting rules, ensuring transparency and alignment with your society's bylaws, which enhances administrative control.\n\nWould you like to explore specific features or discuss how FLATBRIZ can be tailored to your upcoming projects?	2	{}	f	2026-09-17 10:30:58.746
1afc884d-919c-48e9-b890-1cd4ee10e3e6	rwa_president	Why should I choose FLATBRIZ?	Choosing FLATBRIZ offers several key advantages for your society. Firstly, our UPI-first collection method eliminates any gateway commission on maintenance payments, directly protecting your financial corpus. This is complemented by a transparent per-flat ledger, which significantly reduces disputes and saves valuable time for RWA presidents like yourself. \n\nAdditionally, FLATBRIZ provides robust visitor and gate management features without requiring a separate tool, ensuring you maintain operational efficiency. Unlike some competitors, we allow for customizable maintenance and expense-splitting rules tailored to your society's specific bylaws. \n\nWould you like to explore any specific features or benefits further?	2	{}	f	2026-09-17 10:31:01.412
c393259b-f5af-4869-bfa8-e5b3899db794	committee_member	Why should I choose FLATBRIZ?	Choosing FLATBRIZ offers several distinct advantages for your society management needs. Firstly, our UPI-first collection system eliminates gateway commissions on maintenance payments, which can lead to significant cost savings compared to platforms like MyGate. Additionally, FLATBRIZ simplifies administrative tasks with features like automatic bill generation, corpus fund tracking, and a transparent audit trail, all of which reduce the manual spreadsheet work typically required by treasurers.\n\nMoreover, FLATBRIZ provides flexibility in configuring maintenance and expense-splitting rules according to your society's specific bylaws, unlike NoBroker, which standardizes across many societies. This ensures that your financial management aligns perfectly with your AGM-approved guidelines. Would you like to explore any specific features in more detail?	2	{}	f	2026-09-17 10:31:03.083
d7d25a94-0d6d-4435-918d-c7ece64ae969	rwa_president	How fast can residents actually start using this, and what does it cost you in fees?	Residents can start using FLATBRIZ seamlessly as we facilitate a fast migration from your existing systems, such as Excel or Google Sheets. The setup involves transferring flats, residents, and opening balances without a disruptive cutover, allowing billing to continue from the next cycle.\n\nRegarding costs, it's important to compare the total cost rather than just the subscription fee. Many current tools charge payment-gateway commissions on maintenance collections, which can add up significantly, especially for larger societies. FLATBRIZ offers zero gateway commission on UPI collections, which can lead to substantial savings. Would you like to discuss your society's approximate monthly collection amount to see how the savings could apply to you?	7	{objection:pricing}	f	2026-09-17 10:31:04.827
