dac5e2a6-e278-479f-a7e0-deb7e1ae8484	committee_member	How does FLATBRIZ handle maintenance bill payments and gateway fees?	FLATBRIZ handles maintenance bill payments through a UPI-first collection method, which posts payments directly to the flat's ledger without any additional settlement lag. This means that payments are recorded immediately with the UPI transaction reference as proof, eliminating the common delays associated with traditional payment gateways. Additionally, FLATBRIZ charges zero payment gateway commission on maintenance collections, ensuring that more of the funds collected stay within the society rather than being deducted as fees. This approach not only enhances administrative control but also improves financial transparency for managing committee members.\n\nWould you like to explore more about how this can benefit your society specifically?	7	{objection:payment_gateway_lag}	f	2026-09-17 10:45:16.904
